# Line endings (2026-10-10): LF everywhere, in the repository and in working copies, whatever the machine's core.autocrlf. An agent's
# edits (sed, perl, scripts) write LF; mixed with CRLF working copies they left files half and half.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.psd binary
*.glb binary
*.vrm binary
*.ico binary
